<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>GatorBait Magazine: Postgame Edition, South Carolina 38, Florida 19</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Buddy Martin on a lousy Homecoming, Franz Beard, Chris Spears' best shots, the quotes, and what Texas did Saturday before Florida arrives.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#14243D" font-size="15px" line-height="1.55" />
      <mj-button background-color="#FA4616" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0" inner-padding="14px 26px" font-size="14px" font-weight="800" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#F4F6FA" width="620px">
    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="22px 24px 14px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="30px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="0.5px">GATOR<span style="color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="2px 0 0" color="#D5DFEC" font-size="12px" letter-spacing="3px">MAGAZINE NEWSLETTER</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/16b519_46d2d14e73354d91b7f848e45cceabb5~mv2.jpg" alt="Florida coach Jon Sumrall takes the field before the South Carolina game at Ben Hill Griffin Stadium on Oct. 10. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=cover" padding="0" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="22px 26px 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#D8450C" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.6px">POSTGAME EDITION</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 10px" color="#081B35" font-size="30px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.1">Buddy Blog: Can Sumrall Swim in the Deep End of This Cesspool?</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 14px" color="#33425C" font-size="16px" line-height="1.5">South Carolina beat No. 16 Florida 38-19 in the 500th game in The Swamp. Florida is 4-2 and 2-2 in the SEC. Buddy Martin leads the issue. Inside: Franz Beard, Chris Spears' best shots, what Sumrall, Stockton and Chiles said, and a look at Texas, which lost Saturday before Florida visits Austin.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/buddy-blog-can-sumrall-swim-in-the-deep-end-of-this-cesspool?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=buddy_column" align="center" padding="4px 0 6px">READ BUDDY'S COLUMN</mj-button>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=open_magazine" background-color="#0021A5" align="center" padding="0 0 14px">OPEN THE POSTGAME MAGAZINE</mj-button>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/members-download-the-postgame-magazine-pdf?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=members_pdf" align="center" padding="0 0 14px">MEMBERS: DOWNLOAD THE PDF</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#EEF2FB" padding="20px 26px 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/16b519_6c0bd115c2c849bca004f49afa7ae417~mv2.jpg" alt="The Florida offensive line works against the South Carolina front at Ben Hill Griffin Stadium on Oct. 10. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/after-a-second-sobering-loss-can-florida-s-season-still-be-salvaged?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=franz_cover_photo" padding="0 0 14px" />
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px" color="#081B35" font-size="19px" font-weight="800">Inside this issue</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 11px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.35"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#D8450C;text-transform:uppercase;">Franz Beard</span><br/><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/after-a-second-sobering-loss-can-florida-s-season-still-be-salvaged?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=franz" style="color:#081B35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">After a second sobering loss, can Florida's season still be salvaged?</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 11px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.35"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#D8450C;text-transform:uppercase;">Sideline column</span><br/><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/from-the-sideline-chris-spears-on-the-500th-game-in-the-swamp?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=chris_sideline" style="color:#081B35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">From the Sideline: Chris Spears on the 500th Game in The Swamp</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 11px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.35"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#D8450C;text-transform:uppercase;">Photos</span><br/><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/chris-spears-best-shots-south-carolina-38-florida-19?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=best_shots" style="color:#081B35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Chris Spears' Best Shots: South Carolina 38, Florida 19</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 11px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.35"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#D8450C;text-transform:uppercase;">In their words</span><br/><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/it-s-a-player-thing-stockton-sumrall-and-chiles-after-south-carolina-loss?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=quotes" style="color:#081B35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">'It's a player thing': Stockton, Sumrall and Chiles after South Carolina loss</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 11px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.35"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#D8450C;text-transform:uppercase;">Game story</span><br/><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/south-carolina-beats-no-16-florida-38-19-spoiling-homecoming-in-the-swamp?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=game_story" style="color:#081B35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">South Carolina beats No. 16 Florida 38-19, spoiling Homecoming in The Swamp</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 11px" font-size="15px" line-height="1.35"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#D8450C;text-transform:uppercase;">Texas week</span><br/><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/texas-commit-easton-royal-back-in-the-swamp-a-week-before-florida-plays-the-longhorns?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=easton_royal" style="color:#081B35;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Texas commit Easton Royal back in The Swamp a week before Florida plays the Longhorns</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="22px 26px 22px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#FA4616" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.6px">LOOKING AHEAD</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 10px" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="24px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15">Florida at Texas, Saturday at noon ET on ABC</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 14px" color="#D5DFEC" font-size="15px" line-height="1.5">Texas was No. 1 until Oklahoma beat the Longhorns 27-24 on Tate Sandell's 47-yard field goal as time expired at the Cotton Bowl in Dallas. Texas is 4-1, 1-1 in the SEC. Rankings update after Sunday's polls. The postgame magazine has the full look at Texas next to Florida's numbers.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/magazine?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_sc_2026_10_11&utm_content=texas_lookahead" align="center" padding="0">SEE THE TEXAS LOOK-AHEAD</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="16px 26px 22px">
